<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean forex market closed for Christmas day.</title>
<headline>S.Korean forex market closed for Christmas day.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South Korean foreign exchange market is closed on Wednesday for Christmas day. The market will open again on Thursday.</p>
<p>The won ended at 844.70, up from its opening of 844.90 on Tuesday as banks bought dollars to cover import settlements.</p>
<p>--Jean Yoon (822) 727 5643</p>
